        "created_at": "2015-06-14T06:01:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>With e3 starting this week, what games are you excited for? Should Handelabra do an E3 presentation even if it just turns out to be something crazy like their sentinels of the multiverse the video game the board game presentation?</p><p>i am probably most excited to see some footage of dungeon defenders 2. Great little indie game, even if the online community can be jerks at time. Also excited to see some ps4 exclusives, (possibly new infamous), assassins creed syndicate (because I didn't get my fill of killing the British in revolution), and hopefully an announcement from rocksteady on what superhero they want to tackle next now that they are done with batman. Possibly elder scrolls 6 but looks like we are getting fallout 4 instead.</p><p>And yes I think Handelabra should have an E3 presentation just because I think it would be a fun presentation to watch.</p>",
