        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/839c29/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-06-15T18:51:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So Microsoft had their stuff and surprisingly turned out decent. Highlights include backwards capability coming, rare collection aka 30 games for 30 dollars and all of them are great games. Hololens looks like another gimmick that will go no where. Tomb raider looks great, can't wait for it to come home where it belongs on the ps4. Plants vs zombies 2 also looks great and the first one was a hidden gem of the early ps4 days imo. So what does everyone else thing. Will post about the other conferences later</p>",
